From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 17:13:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sqllab): save a query once when Save is clicked again
 while saving

The Save query modal's Save, Save as new and Update buttons were only
disabled for an empty name. The modal stays open until the request
resolves, so a second click on a slow save (a double click is enough)
posted /api/v1/saved_query/ again and created a duplicate saved query.
Disable the buttons while a save or update is in progress.

Generated-by: Claude Code
